roves concentration, accepts correlation, and reallocates after evidence arrives.\",\n    \"stop_authority\": \"Owner stops or shrinks a bet when its discriminator fails or learning value falls below alternatives.\",\n    \"durable_learning\": \"Track evidence correlation, option value, decision thresholds, and reinvestment outcomes.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"n13\",\n    \"domain\": \"early_stop\",\n    \"task\": \"Correct one isolated typo in a low-value internal sentence with no recurrence evidence.\",\n    \"binding_constraint\": \"The defect is isolated, low impact, and provides no evidence for systemic intervention.\",\n    \"first_action\": \"Correct the typo in place.\",\n    \"machine_work\": \"Apply the minimal text edit and verify the sentence.\",\n    \"selector\": \"Select the direct correction; do not create a broader workstream without recurrence evidence.\",\n    \"human_object\": \"Requester confirms the corrected wording if ambiguity remains.\",\n    \"stop_authority\": \"Requester may stop after the isolated correction is verified.\",\n    \"durable_learning\": \"Record no systemic learning unless recurrence or material impact later appears.\"\n  }\n]"}}
